body.prompt:
Evaluate one eval case (index ${index}, id ${item.id}).

The case below contains the EXPECTED (or CRITERIA) and the OUTPUT to judge:

${item.input}

Rubric: ${rubric}

Apply the rubric: give a 1-5 correctness score for the OUTPUT, one sentence of justification, and a PASS/FAIL verdict.

phases.prompt:
Per-case correctness scores:
${caseScores}

Produce one consolidated eval report: how many cases were scored, the overall verdict, the average/weakest score, and the specific cases (by id/index) that scored low and need attention.
